			"notes": "# ModernDifficultyLocker - 1.4.0\n\n## What is changed?\nChange version number from previous to `1.4.0`\n\n### ➕Add:\n- Require only cheats (admin mode) for the game-rule editor button in GuiWorldSettings: drop the creative-mode gate, simplify the disabled tooltip, and remove the obsolete needCreative/needCreativeAndCheats lang keys; also include pending CatFrame v0.10.12 bump, ConfirmScreen migration in MixinGuiOptions and the new ru_ru locale\n- Add zh_tw, en_gb and fr_fr localization files, complete ru_ru translations and fix %s placeholder plus missing space in en_us\n\n### 🔧Fix:\n- No fixes.\n\n### ❗❗❗Deprecated:\n- Refactor WorldDifficultyData to extend WorldSavedData and delegate persistence to the running world's MapStorage; remove manual CompressedStreamTools file IO, immediate client-thread writes and saveWorldData calls; setters now markDirty and data flushes via WorldServer.saveLevel; unloadWorldData only detaches the static handle so the final save still writes real values\n\n\n## Notes\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/song682/ModernDifficultyLocker/commits/v1.4.0\n\nIf you update the previous version to this version please search and delete the difficultylock.dat file at your saves folder before you install this version, this version will change the way the mod save some data. And previous file won't be used. I recommend you delete the unused files."
		},
